{
  "title": "AcadConf - Monitoring",
  "uid": "acadconf-monitoring",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "CPU global (machine)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-uid" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-uid" },
          "expr": "100 - (avg(rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{mode=\"idle\"}[1m])) * 100)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "percent" }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "RAM globale (machine)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-uid" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-uid" },
          "expr": "(1 - (node_memory_MemAvailable_bytes / node_memory_MemTotal_bytes)) * 100",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "percent" }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Espace disque disponible",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-uid" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-uid" },
          "expr": "node_filesystem_avail_bytes{mountpoint=\"/\"}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "bytes" }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Uptime",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-uid" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-uid" },
          "expr": "time() - node_boot_time_seconds",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s" }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Requêtes HTTP/s",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 16 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-uid" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-uid" },
          "expr": "rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{job=\"app\"}[1m])",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": {}, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Limite connue",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 16 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### ⚠️ Limite connue\n\nLes métriques **CPU/RAM par conteneur** (cAdvisor) ne fonctionnent pas en environnement **Docker Desktop / WSL2** — une limitation architecturale documentée, pas un bug de notre configuration.\n\n**Fonctionnelles sur l'instance OVH réelle**, où Docker tourne nativement sur un vrai noyau Linux.\n\nEn attendant, ce dashboard utilise les métriques **Node Exporter** (machine entière) comme substitut temporaire pour CPU et RAM."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "CPU par conteneur - app (cAdvisor, OVH uniquement)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 24 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-uid" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-uid" },
          "expr": "rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{container_label_com_docker_compose_service=\"app\"}[1m])",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": {}, "overrides": [] }
    }
  ]
}
